!id: ghDXLcvGHI
!text: \[ \int {{c2::\operatorname{sech} u \tanh u::\ldots}} \, du = {{c1::-\operatorname{sech} u::\ldots}} + C \]
!related:
\[
\begin{align*}
\int \sec u \tan u \, du &= \sec u + C \\
