!id: r10Saw0GrC
!text: \[ \int {{c2::u e^u::\ldots}} \, du = {{c1::u e^u - e^u::\ldots}} + C \]
~~~

!id: be075YRI33
!text: \[ \int {{c2::\ln u::\ldots}} \, du = {{c1::u \ln u - u::\ldots}} + C \]
